"> \t\t \t\t\t<a href=\"/wiki/File:Gift_of_Frozen_flames.png\" class=\"info-icon\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></a> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t\t\t<p class=\"caption\">Gift of Frozen Flames</p> \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\">Description</span></h2>\n<p><b>Gift of Frozen Flames</b> is an exclusive gift added in the <a href=\"/wiki/2025_Christmas_Event\" title=\"2025 Christmas Event\">2025 Christmas Event</a>. It's a short, blue gift with stars and a white bow. Something interesting is that it's clearly a cube-shaped model that's been scaled to be wider, seen in the warped star texture.\n</p>\n<figure class=\"thumb  show-info-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\" style=\"width: 452px\"> \t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/a/ae/Gift_of_Frozen_Flames_in_Santas_workshop_for_50.000_snowflakes.png/revision/latest?cb=20251221012821\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Gift of Frozen Flames in Santas workshop for ❄️50\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/a/ae/Gift_of_Frozen_Flames_in_Santas_workshop_for_50.000_snowflakes.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/452?cb=20251221012821\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"452\" height=\"296\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-image-name=\"Gift of Frozen Flames in Santas workshop for 50.000 snowflakes.png\" data-image-key=\"Gift_of_Frozen_Flames_in_Santas_workshop_for_50.000_snowflakes.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a> \t \t<figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> \t\t \t\t\t<a href=\"/wiki/File:Gift_of_Frozen_Flames_in_Santas_workshop_for_50.000_snowflakes.png\" class=\"info-icon\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></a> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t\t\t<p class=\"caption\"><b>Gift of Frozen Flames in Santas workshop for ❄️50.000</b></p> \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>\n<p>can be obtained through the <a href=\"/wiki/Christmas_Daily_Advent_Calendar\" title=\"Christmas Daily Advent Calendar\">Christmas Daily Advent Calendar</a>, or buyed in <a href=\"/wiki/Santa%27s_Workshop\" title=\"Santa&#39;s Workshop\">Santa's Workshop</a> for ❄️50.000.\n</p><p>When opening you get an <a href=\"/wiki/Icethrower\" title=\"Icethrower\">Icethrower</a>.\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260902202351\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.032 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.038 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 47/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 59/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 5/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 28/5000000 bytes\nLua time usage: 0.007/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1019515/104857600 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   28.558      1 Template:Objects\n100.00%   28.558      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.9_prod_oaklands:pcache:idhash:4745-0!sseVary=RegularPage!FandomDesktop!LegacyGalleries and timestamp 20260902202351 and revision id 20950. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>","categories":[],"links":[{"title":"2025 Christmas Event","exists":true},{"title":"Christmas Daily Advent Calendar","exists":true},{"title":"Icethrower","exists":true},{"title":"Santa's Workshop","exists":true}],"images":["Frozen_Flames_Gift.png","Gift_of_Frozen_flames.png","Gift_of_Frozen_Flames_in_Santas_workshop_for_50.000_snowflakes.png"]}
